tly_brushed\",\"plotly_brushing\",\"plotly_clickannotation\",\"plotly_doubleclick\",\"plotly_deselect\",\"plotly_afterplot\",\"plotly_sunburstclick\"],\"base_url\":\"https://plot.ly\"},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n\nThirty-seven speeds. Borno, the deadliest state, is fifth from the bottom.\n:::\n:::\n\n\n*Pattern: every interval but four sits right of zero; the spread is nearly the size of the national trend itself.*\n\n### The deadliest state is not the fastest\n\nBorno is +8.9 per cent a year (model), the third slowest in the country. It carries 30 per cent of all deaths since 2019 (data).\n\nRank the states by toll and by speed, and the lists barely overlap: rank correlation 0.21 (model). The fastest risers are small: Kwara has 430 deaths in eleven years (data), one-eightieth of Borno's.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {#fig-speed-size .cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"htmlwidget-6b0ec4827bb7525516cf\" style=\"width:100%;height:406px;\" class=\"plotly html-widget\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-6b0ec4827bb7525516cf\">{\"x\":{\"visdat\":{\"19801f978a6\":[\"function () \",\"plotlyVisDat\"]},\"cur_data\":\"19801f978a6\",\"attrs\":{\"19801f978a6\":{\"x\":{},\"y\":{},\"mode\":\"markers\",\"marker\":{\"color\":{},\"size\":10,\"opacity\":0.84999999999999998},\"text\":{},\"hovertemplate\":\"%{text}<br>%{x:,.0f} deaths, %{y:.1f}% a year<extra><\\/extra>\",\"alpha_stroke\":1,\"sizes\":[10,100],\"spans\":[1,20],\"type\":\"scatter\"}},\"layout\":{\"height\":420,\"margin\":{\"b\":10,\"l\":10,\"t\":30,\"r\":30},\"showlegend\":false,\"shapes\":[{\"type\":\"line\",\"xref\":\"paper\",\"x0\":0,\"x1\":1,\"y0\":22.945323953401097,\"y1\":22.945323953401097,\"line\":{\"color\":\"#57606a\",\"width\":1,\"dash\":\"dot\"}}],\"annotations\":[{\"x\":5183,\"y\":17.318517748616969,\"text\":\"Benue\",\"showarrow\":false,\"xshift\":0,\"yshift\":14,\"font\":{\"size\":11,\"color\":\"#0f766e\"}},{\"x\":35355,\"y\":8.9018325687151734,\"text\":\"